Z||000000||FieroWenchSE||10-24-2000||08:03 AM||||Okay....I'm a couple days late posting this and I really don't know if this is worthy of a post but....oh well....<P>On Saturday Oct 21st I finally really got to help fix my boyfriends fiero with him and his brother....His Oil Filter and Pump were acting up and had to be changed.  I never knew what a hard job it could be....but of course I never realised that you actually had to hoist the engine up and take a couple parts out in order to reach the oil pan!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I was just so excited that I actually got to get underneath the car and do the really really dirty jobs!!!  Had to post it.....By the way....I also never realized that you could fit 3 people under a fiero!!!!<BR>:P<BR><p>[This message has been edited by FieroWenchSE (edited 10-24-2000).]||||reg||10
